{"id":4590642,"accountId":29,"type":"text","title":"'Back to normal': Pegula ready for late-season push in Wuhan","description":"Jessica Pegula returns to the Asian swing feeling healthy and motivated to finish the 2026 season strong, with a Wuhan title and a spot in the WTA Finals in her sights.","date":"2026-10-11T19:22:00Z","location":"","coordinates":[0.0,0.0],"commentsOn":false,"copyright":null,"publishFrom":1791746533053,"publishTo":0,"tags":[{"id":9049,"label":"Player Feature"},{"id":4886,"label":"News"}],"platform":"PULSE_CMS","language":"en","additionalInfo":{},"canonicalUrl":"","references":[{"label":null,"id":316956,"type":"TENNIS_PLAYER","sid":"316956"},{"label":null,"id":1075,"type":"TENNIS_TOURNAMENTGROUP","sid":"1075"}],"related":[{"label":"Zheng Qinwen makes history with China Open win in first title since 2024","id":4590546,"type":"TEXT","sid":"4590546"},{"label":"Best of Wuhan media day: Top quotes and Kostyuk, Eala's adventures","id":4590461,"type":"TEXT","sid":"4590461"},{"label":"Noskova pulls out of Wuhan with left calf injury","id":4590448,"type":"TEXT","sid":"4590448"}],"metadata":{},"titleTranslations":null,"lastModified":1791806843749,"titleUrlSegment":"back-to-normal-pegula-ready-for-late-season-push-in-wuhan","visibilityOrder":[],"allowedUserGroups":[],"allowedTerritories":[],"body":"<p>Jessica Pegula may be getting a late start to her Asian swing, but the top-ranked American still has plenty to play for in the final weeks of the 2026 WTA Tour Driven by Mercedes-Benz season.</p>\n<p>Sidelined since reaching the US Open semifinals after what she called a “long summer,” Pegula said she is healthy again and motivated to finish the year strong. She reached at least the semifinals in three of the four tournaments she played during the hard-court stretch following Wimbledon, ending with a loss to Aryna Sabalenka in New York.</p>\n<p>Afterward, Pegula, 32, acknowledged the physical toll of her schedule and withdrew from Singapore and Beijing. She returns this week at the Dongfeng · Voyah Wuhan Open, where she is the defending finalist.</p>\n<p>“Sometimes things can happen because of the accumulation of a lot of matches, playing a lot of tennis,” Pegula said ahead of the event.</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n        <aside class=\"instagram-post embeddable-widget embeddable-widget--floating embeddable-widget--centered-mobile \"><blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeWdXAsjdGS/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeWdXAsjdGS/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> <div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\"> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div> <div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"https://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=