</div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"> <div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeWdXAsjdGS/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by 2026 DONGFENG •VOYAH WUHAN OPEN (@wuhanopenwta)</a></p></div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><p>\"When a big tournament finally ends, I think sometimes, for me at least, I start feeling a little bit run down. For me to balance how I'm feeling physically and mentally, it's always to know when I'm at that threshold and maybe it's time to let my body recover and catch up to all the activity and adrenaline that I was going through for the last few months.\"</p>\n<p class=\"x12ofw9d\">Now feeling \"back to normal\" after several weeks of routine at home with husband Taylor Gahagen and their three dogs, Pegula is ready to make the most of her remaining tournaments, though she has yet to officially secure a place at the WTA Finals.</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n</div><p class=\"x12ofw9d\">Currently No. 3 in the Race to the WTA Finals, Pegula said she always intended to return to Wuhan, where she'll look to build momentum ahead of a potential fifth consecutive appearance at the year-end championships.</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n</div><p>\"I think competing at a WTA 1000 is always a good time to win the tournament and to try to do your best,\" she said. \"I didn't necessarily want to skip Beijing, so for me, coming back to Wuhan was something I always planned to do.\"</p>\n<p>Seeded No. 2 in Wuhan, Pegula opens against the winner of Jelena Ostapenko and Daria Kasatkina.</p>","author":"WTA Staff","subtitle":"2026 Wuhan","summary":"Jessica Pegula returns to the Asian swing feeling healthy and motivated to finish the 2026 season strong, with a Wuhan title and a spot in the WTA Finals in her sights.","hotlinkUrl":null,"duration":110,"contentSummary":null,"leadMedia":{"id":4590648,"accountId":29,"type":"photo","title":"Jessica_Pegula_-_US_Open_2026_-_Day_8-DSC_2199A","description":null,"date":"2026-10-11T19:44:00Z","location":null,"coordinates":[0.0,0.0],"commentsOn":false,"copyright":null,"publishFrom":1791747875343,"publishTo":0,"tags":[],"platform":"PULSE_CMS","language":"en","additionalInfo":{},"canonicalUrl":"","references":[],"related":[],"metadata":{"credit":"Jimmie48/WTA"},"titleTranslations":null,"lastModified":1791747902744,"titleUrlSegment":"jessica_pegula_-_us_open_2026_-_day_8-dsc_2199a","visibilityOrder":[],"allowedUserGroups":[],"allowedTerritories":[],"subtitle":null,"onDemandUrl":"https://photoresources.wtatennis.com/photo-resources/2026/10/11/5fb665ce-f74c-4aa7-aa38-ae2c7174fd54/Jessica_Pegula_-_US_Open_2026_-_Day_8-DSC_2199A.jpg","originalDetails":{"width":4256,"height":2938,"aspectRatio":1.4486045},"imageUrl":"https://ph